{"sha": "22cfd951cf683c7a1b0d10121f52b9eb00f9ef7cd8e6dd421214cea20cc029d1", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:first-law} 章 --- 热力学第一定律}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:first-law:1}", "$Q = C_{P,m}\\Delta T = 29.1 \\times 100 = \\qty{2.91}{kJ}$; $W = -nR\\Delta T =", "\\qty{-0.83}{kJ}$; $\\Delta U = Q + W = \\qty{2.08}{kJ} = C_{V,m}\\Delta T$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:first-law:2}", "$W = -nRT\\ln(V_2/V_1) = -2494\\ln(0.25) = \\qty{+3.46}{kJ}$；由 $\\Delta U = 0$ 得", "$Q = \\qty{-3.46}{kJ}$（传给热源）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:first-law:3}", "$T_2 = T_1 \\times 10^{\\gamma - 1} = 300 \\times 10^{0.4} = \\qty{754}{K}$; $P_2 =", "10^{1.4} = \\qty{25}{bar}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:first-law:4}", "氩：$C_{V,m} = \\tfrac32 R = 12.5$，$C_{P,m} = \\tfrac52 R = 20.8$ J/(mol K)，", "$\\gamma = 1.67$；氮气：$20.8$、$29.1$、$\\gamma = 1.40$。对于水，", "加热时膨胀很小，因此定压过程中的功 $P\\,\\dd V$", "相对于热量可忽略：$c_P - c_V \\approx 0$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:first-law:5}", "$T_f = (200 \\times 80 + 300 \\times 20)/500 = \\qty{44}{\\degreeCelsius}$。计入杯子后：", "cup: $(200 \\times 4.18 \\times 80 + (300 \\times 4.18 + 80) \\times 20)/(500 \\times", "4.18 + 80) = \\qty{43}{\\degreeCelsius}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:first-law:6}", "冰升温至 $0$：$0.050 \\times 2100 \\times 10 = \\qty{1.05}{kJ}$；熔化：", "\\qty{16.7}{kJ}；合计 \\qty{17.8}{kJ}。水降至", "$0$ 时可放出 \\qty{25.1}{kJ}，冰全部熔化；随后 $0.250 \\times 4180\\,T_f = 25.1 - 17.8$ kJ，得 $T_f =", "\\qty{7}{\\degreeCelsius}$。若取 \\qty{150}{g} 冰，则需 \\qty{53.3}{kJ} $>$ \\qty{25.1}{kJ}：", "只有 $(25.1 - 3.15)/334 = \\qty{66}{g}$ 的冰熔化，$T_f = \\qty{0}{\\degreeCelsius}$，", "仍余 \\qty{84}{g} 冰。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:first-law:7}", "$W = -P_1(V_2 - V_1) + 0 - P_2(V_1 - V_2) + 0 = (P_2 - P_1)(V_2 - V_1) > 0$:", "循环沿逆时针方向进行（低压下膨胀，", "高压下压缩），因此气体\\emph{得到}净功，其数值等于", "所围面积；若沿顺时针方向进行，则对外输出净功 --- 这就是热机。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:first-law:8}", "$T_2 = 300 \\times 7^{0.286} = \\qty{523}{K}$。压缩后变热的空气", "每次冲程都通过传导加热气筒。轮胎中的空气在定容下冷却至", "环境温度，此时 $P \\propto T$，压强按温度之比", "下降 --- 需重新充气。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:first-law:9}", "$W = 0$（无外压可抗衡），$Q = 0$：$\\Delta U = 0$，", "因此对理想气体 $\\Delta T = 0$。不可逆过程：气体不会", "自行流回原处。实际气体的分子间相互吸引，会略微降温", "（随着分子彼此分开，部分动能转化为势能）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:first-law:10}", "$Q = L_v = \\qty{2.26}{MJ}$; $W = -P(V_g - V_l) = -1.013\\times10^5 \\times 1.67 =", "\\qty{-0.17}{MJ}$；$\\Delta U = \\qty{2.09}{MJ}$：热量的 $93\\%$ 用于", "使分子分开（内能），$7\\%$ 用于", "克服大气压做功。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:first-law:11}", "$W = -P_2(V_2 - V_1)$, $\\Delta U = nC_{V,m}(T_2 - T_1)$, $V_2 = nRT_2/P_2$, $V_1", "= nRT_1/P_1$: $\\tfrac52(T_2 - 300) = -T_2 + 300 \\times 5$, $3.5T_2 = 2250$,", "$T_2 = \\qty{643}{K}$，$V_2 = \\qty{10.7}{L}$。可逆时：$T_2 = 300 \\times", "5^{0.286} = \\qty{475}{K}$，$V_2 = \\qty{7.9}{L}$。突然压缩对气体所做的", "功更多（整个 \\qty{5}{bar} 的压强从一开始就作用），末态", "温度更高，压缩得更少。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:first-law:12}", "$\\rho = PM/RT = \\qty{1.20}{kg/m^3}$: $\\sqrt{\\gamma P/\\rho} = \\sqrt{1.4 \\times", "1.013\\times10^5/1.20} = \\qty{343}{m/s}$; $\\sqrt{P/\\rho} = \\qty{290}{m/s}$, $15\\%$", "偏低。由 $P/\\rho = RT/M$ 得 $c = \\sqrt{\\gamma RT/M}$；与 $u = \\sqrt{3RT/M}$ 相比", "= \\qty{502}{m/s}: $c/u = \\sqrt{\\gamma/3} = 0.68$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:first-law:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $n = P_1V_1/RT_1 = 10^5 \\times 2.12\\times10^{-4}/2494 = \\qty{8.5e-3}{mol}$.", "", "\\textbf{2.} $PV^\\gamma$ 为常量：$V_2 = V_1(P_1/P_2)^{1/\\gamma} = 212 \\times", "7^{-0.714} = \\qty{53}{cm^3}$.", "", "\\textbf{3.} $T_2 = T_1(P_2/P_1)^{(\\gamma - 1)/\\gamma} = 300 \\times 7^{0.286} =", "\\qty{523}{K}$.", "", "\\textbf{4.} $W = nC_{V,m}(T_2 - T_1) = 8.5\\times10^{-3} \\times 20.8 \\times 223 =", "\\qty{39}{J}$.", "", "\\textbf{5.} 需补充的空气：$\\Delta n = \\Delta P\\,V/RT = 6\\times10^5 \\times 2\\times10^{-3}/", "2494 = \\qty{0.48}{mol}$：$0.48/8.5\\times10^{-3} = 57$ 次冲程，约", "\\qty{2.2}{kJ} --- 相当于一分钟实实在在的体力劳动。", "", "\\textbf{6.} 定容时 $P \\propto T$：空气冷却，压强随之下降", "（对最后一次冲程的空气，至多降为 $300/523$ 倍）；骑车人", "停顿后补打几次。", "", "\\textbf{7.} $W_{\\text{等温}} = nRT\\ln(P_2/P_1) = 8.5\\times10^{-3} \\times 2494 \\times", "1.95 = \\qty{41}{J} > \\qty{39}{J}$：等温过程使气体", "进一步压缩（体积为 \\qty{30}{cm^3}，而非 \\qty{53}{cm^3}）以达到 \\qty{7}{bar}，", "因为温度保持较低 --- 扫过的体积更大，做功也就更多。", "", "\\textbf{8.} $n = 10^5 \\times 5\\times10^{-4}/2494 = \\qty{0.020}{mol}$; $T_2 =", "300 \\times 20^{0.4} = \\qty{994}{K}$.", ""]}